  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive).\n\nCOMPOUND: {役|やく} (role, use) + {立|た}つ (to stand)\n\nCONJUGATION (godan): {役立|やくだ}つ → {役立|やくだ}たない → {役立|やくだ}った → {役立|やくだ}って\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{役立|やくだ}つ (be useful for ~)\n- 〜の{役|やく}に{立|た}つ (be useful for ~) - similar expression\n\nRELATED:\n- {役立|やくだ}てる (to put to use - transitive)\n- {役|やく}に{立|た}つ (to be useful - common expression)\n- {有益|ゆうえき} (beneficial, useful)\n- {便利|べんり} (convenient, useful)",
